{"1205660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"WOLFHOUND","steam_appid":1205660,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"When a clandestine <strong>NAZI BASE<\/strong> is discovered in the otherworldly heart of the <strong>BERMUDA TRIANGLE<\/strong>, there’s only one soldier for the job…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/ac8bdf2922ed3f1c077eb727398e9a68.poster.avif?t=1764617396\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/ac8bdf2922ed3f1c077eb727398e9a68.webm?t=1764617396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/ac8bdf2922ed3f1c077eb727398e9a68.mp4?t=1764617396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>Capt. Chuck “WOLFHOUND” Rossetti<\/strong>, a wise-cracking, one-man army who never leaves a pal behind, is no stranger to war but his war is about to get stranger. After an Allied vessel vanishes, Chuck is deployed to infiltrate an uncharted island, discover the enemy’s secrets, and bring our boys home.<br><br>Yet this evil, shrouded island has other plans. Pitted against the stuff of nightmares — mutant insects, zombies, and other twisted creations of a mad Axis scientist — Chuck finds himself on an eerie, perilous mission unlike any he's faced before.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/3a566f7a1e59d2c7ade6056e5c1edd41.poster.avif?t=1764617396\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/3a566f7a1e59d2c7ade6056e5c1edd41.webm?t=1764617396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/3a566f7a1e59d2c7ade6056e5c1edd41.mp4?t=1764617396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>VENTURE FORTH INTO THE ISLAND<\/strong>, scavenging for weapons and ammo to dispatch the Axis soldiers and monsters that grow more grotesque and dangerous the further WOLFHOUND goes. Unveil the sinister experiments of Dr. Steiner and turn his tech against him. Feel the unbridled power of the railgun. Reach new heights with the jetpack. Lace up gravity boots to traverse new areas, where castles pierce the sky and crystal caverns veil wicked, fascinating mysteries. . .<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/51c69065155a8ec5ed1832f28fdbc468.poster.avif?t=1764617396\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/51c69065155a8ec5ed1832f28fdbc468.webm?t=1764617396\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1205660\/extras\/51c69065155a8ec5ed1832f28fdbc468.mp4?t=1764617396\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><br>• <strong>Explore<\/strong> a massive, hand-crafted island with 10 interconnected areas<br>• <strong>Relive<\/strong> an iconic era of action gaming with challenging 2D mechanics and authentic pixel art (320x180 native res), with native 4K resolution and your choice of razor sharp pixels or convincing CRT effects<br>• <strong>Survive<\/strong> and thrive with cutting-edge technology like an upgradable jetpack, offering new strategies for overcoming obstacles<br>• <strong>Unleash<\/strong> deadly weaponry against foes both human and monstrous with arsenal ranging from conventional fir